  "script": "Log mujhe poochte hain, bhai Madurai mein nightlife kaisi hai? Nightlife? Bhai... tumhe kuch nahi pata.\n\nYahaan raat ke 10 baje ke baad zindagi ruk jaati hai. Aur main mazaak nahi kar raha.\n\nHighway pe nikal jao 10–11 baje. Street light off. Dukanein band. Log so chuke hote hain.\n\nKoi club nahi. Koi lounge nahi. Late-night cafe bhool jao. Bar? Ek dhoondh loge shayad... lekin 10 baje ke baad woh bhi nahi.\n\nToh agar tum yahaan enjoy karne aa rahe ho... toh bhai bhool jao. Yahaan enjoy ki definition thodi alag hai.\n\nIsliye toh main camera kholke Instagram pe reels bana raha hoon. Aur kya karun?",
